{"id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-s2-theory.md","title":"S2-theory","display":"df-s2-theory — S2-theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-s2-theory","aliases":["72-df-s2-theory"],"display":"df-s2-theory — S2-theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-basic-axioms]]","[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3.1","source_printed_pages":"101–102","source_pdf_pages":"113–114","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-s2-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-s2-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-s2-theory — S2-theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f08305bb0d508a7d\" href=\"?note=f08305bb0d508a7d\" title=\"72-df-basic-axioms\">72-df-basic-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101–102"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"113–114"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BASIC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BASIC}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f08305bb0d508a7d\" href=\"?note=f08305bb0d508a7d\" title=\"72-df-basic-axioms\">72-df-basic-axioms</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95a33888a8fb67bb\" href=\"?note=95a33888a8fb67bb\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy\">72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a> 的句子公理模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^i\">\\(S_2^i\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2\">\\(S_2\\)</span> 为下式定义的公理集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_2^i:=\\mathrm{BASIC}\\cup(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}),\\qquad\nS_2:=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}S_2^i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_2^i:=\\mathrm{BASIC}\\cup(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}),\\qquad\nS_2:=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}S_2^i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3，印刷 pp. 101–102（PDF pp. 113–114）。原子从只给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^1\">\\(S_2^1\\)</span> 扩充为全层定义，为 witnessing 原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^i\">\\(S_2^i\\)</span> 调用补齐接口。</li>\n<li>旧式本来是 PIND，误写成 LIND；现改正名称，并把各归纳模式放在独立上游。没有以 LIND 偷换公理定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"f08305bb0d508a7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-basic-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"f08305bb0d508a7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}$ 是 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]] 的句子公理模式；$S_2^i$ 和 $S_2$ 为下式定义的公理集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BASIC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}","display":false},{"tex":"S_2^i","display":false},{"tex":"S_2","display":false},{"tex":"S_2^i:=\\mathrm{BASIC}\\cup(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}),\\qquad\nS_2:=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\omega}S_2^i.","display":true},{"tex":"S_2^1","display":false},{"tex":"S_2^i","display":false}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e29245cada99db6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-s2-theory|df-s2-theory — S2-theory]]"},{"id":"5a54a39d9f6bac76","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$S_2^j,T_2^j,S_2,T_2$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]、[[72-df-t2-theory]]；$\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}$、$\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}$、$\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。"},{"id":"7f5fd01e8505fc1f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$；$S_2^i$、$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]；$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。"},{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$k\\in\\omega$；$S_2^i,\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]。$\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})$ 与 $y$ 是互异变量，$A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b$ 的自由变量包含于所显示变量中。"}],"outgoing":["95a33888a8fb67bb","f08305bb0d508a7d","3e0a54fcdc8782f1"]}